      "content": "Wait, you actually gave an opinion there. You said the concerns are \"largely overstated.\" If I'm writing this for a major news outlet, I can't just print \"the AI thinks the critics are wrong.\" Can you explain why you're dismissing the grid stability and cost arguments as overstated instead of treating them as legitimate technical/economic hurdles?",
